menu "DDNS Dynamic DNS"

    config DDNS_ENABLED
        bool "DDNS support"
        default n
        help
            Enable Dynamic DNS client for automatic WAN IP registration
            with NoIP, DuckDNS, or Selfhost.de. All three providers are
            compiled; selection is at runtime via web/CLI.

    config DDNS_POLL_INTERVAL
        int "Keep-alive interval in seconds (compile-time default)"
        range 3600 604800
        default 86400
        depends on DDNS_ENABLED
        help
            Compile-time fallback for the keep-alive interval. The web UI and
            CLI expose this in hours (1-168); this value is always in seconds.
            Default 86400 (24 h) satisfies NoIP's 30-day keepalive requirement.

    config DDNS_SAVE_INTERVAL
        int "Save config to NVS interval in seconds"
        range 60 3600
        default 3600
        depends on DDNS_ENABLED
        help
            Periodically persist DDNS config to NVS (prevents loss on crash).

endmenu
